OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after 'suspicious objects'
OL,4,Afound in search
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after police
OL,7,Fdiscovered several suspicious items in
OL,8,Fa property on the Isle of Wight.
OL,10,FHampshire & Isle of Wight police said
OL,11,Fofficers carried out a search on High
OL,12,FStreet, Ventnor, on Wednesday at about
OL,13,F05:00 GMT while investigating reports
OL,14,Fof weapons offences.
OL,16,FThe force said armed officers were sent
OL,17,Fand a 30-year-old man from the seaside
OL,18,Fresort town had been arrested on
OL,19,Fsuspicion of an offence under the
OL,20,Fexplosives act. He remains in custody.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
