OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after 'suspicious objects'
OL,4,Afound in search
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said there was "no identified
OL,7,Fwider risk to the public at this time"
OL,8,Fand officers would be at the address in
OL,9,Fthe High Street while further inquiries
OL,10,Fwere carried out.
